{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE UNDERGROUND?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-apocalyptic survival game, you wake up deep inside a bunker devastated by catastrophe. The rooms are shrouded in darkness, resources are scarce, and the horrors lurking behind every door won't give you a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the bunker room by room in a procedurally generated world where every run is different. Scavenge supplies, find or craft improvised weapons, and face off against enemies in a turn-based combat system where every decision could mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/248ecc14c4c23a05a7d5ee1ba29e5566.webp?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/c7574c8549ba110fd9fe17eab5e29537.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/c7574c8549ba110fd9fe17eab5e29537.webm?t=1761332108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you closer to exhaustion. Will curiosity lead you deeper, or will caution keep you alive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/b02212ba0a099e1ea159ae2d6a69381c.webp?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/6cfe9c30098d74ee17098ca841753db3.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/6cfe9c30098d74ee17098ca841753db3.webm?t=1761332108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly enemies in tense duels where planning and speed matter. Weapons don't last forever, so choose your battles wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/8111ea127340b44a96dbc00a3bcf4224.webp?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/875b21a56751e1ea8fb254b6004325b6.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/875b21a56751e1ea8fb254b6004325b6.webm?t=1761332108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to cook food, make medicine, create improvised weapons, and upgrade your base. Every resource counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5498c4008a5dc7cc53504067a0b079d2.webp?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/a8f27fcaa19391e13a678b67262fcf10.webp?t=1761332108\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/a8f27fcaa19391e13a678b67262fcf10.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=439 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, completing achievements unlocks permanent perks. At the start of each run, choose which perks to activate, creating different strategies based on your style and progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d937056a28dd803433cacc68fabb06fe.webp?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/c0e18442973de608e54771e978e6d4a1.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/c0e18442973de608e54771e978e6d4a1.webm?t=1761332108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different, and every death is final. But every attempt teaches you something new. Learn, adapt, and survive... <strong>if you can</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590740?t=1761332108","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/ede6822e070d7006fdcf8d7009d0e5468e93eeb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761332108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/f546ee44776078aa03b600cf4251defcd3a702e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761332108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/f546ee44776078aa03b600cf4251defcd3a702e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761332108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"