amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/6cfe9c30098d74ee17098ca841753db3.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/6cfe9c30098d74ee17098ca841753db3.webm?t=1761332108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly enemies in tense duels where planning and speed matter. Weapons don't last forever, so choose your battles wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/8111ea127340b44a96dbc00a3bcf4224.webp?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/875b21a56751e1ea8fb254b6004325b6.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/875b21a56751e1ea8fb254b6004325b6.webm?t=1761332108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to cook food, make medicine, create improvised weapons, and upgrade your base. Every resource counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5498c4008a5dc7cc53504067a0b079d2.webp?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/a8f27fcaa19391e13a678b67262fcf10.webp?t=1761332108\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/a8f27fcaa19391e13a678b67262fcf10.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=439 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, completing achievements unlocks permanent perks. At the start of each run, choose which perks to activate, creating different strategies based on your style and progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d937056a28dd803433cacc68fabb06fe.webp?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/c0e18442973de608e54771e978e6d4a1.poster.avif?t=1761332108\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/c0e18442973de608e54771e978e6d4a1.webm?t=1761332108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different, and every death is final. But every attempt teaches you something new. Learn, adapt, and survive... <strong>if you can</strong>.</p>","developers":["Mentis Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/5f47f0618e6a577ba87e51fcbc29cb80ec71ce2d/header.jpg?t=1761332108","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Mentis Interactive. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3590740/1387879423/ab95ed6f8a0e0deca4764ef376c93b45c03a1336/1760804284/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761329621","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3590740/1387879423/ab95ed6f8a0e0deca4764ef376c93b45c03a1336/1760804284/dash_h2